  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implementation costs to UNICEF for nutrition progamme results in three regions with high levels of malnutrition (Southern Highlands) - Manifesto commitment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Implementation costs to UNICEF for nutrition progamme results in three regions with high levels of malnutrition (Southern Highlands) - Manifesto commitment is a component of Addressing Stunting in Tanzania Early (in the under 5&#x2019;s): ASTUTE reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xA3;11,350,000. It works in the following sector(s): Basic nutrition, Health personnel development.</narrative>
  </description>
